name: Erosion — thin-deck mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erosion gives +4 Mult for each card below the deck's starting size in the full deck.
  First-shop scaling mult: pair with deck-thinning (Immolate, Death, Hanged Man) and
  The Hierophant to keep cards enhanced.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Erosion
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - tarotCard: TheHangedMan
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - tarotCard: Death
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - spectralCard: Immolate
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
